<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!-- Hourly owner of every open PR in a fleet repo, whatever its branch (ASK-3962).
     TEMPLATE, not a loadable plist: __KIPI_REPO__, __HOME__ and __USER__ are
     materialized by install-plist.sh.
     Install: bash q-system/.q-system/scripts/install-plist.sh com.kipi.pr-owner

     WHY IT EXISTS. The dead-end audit of 2026-11-08 found kipi-system #526 (fix/,
     open since 10-07), brag #2 (since 10-24) and ktlyst #8 (since 11-01) with no
     mover: every PR selector read only sana/ heads, and wip_release moves a PR only
     at 5 open sana/ PRs. A consumer nothing invokes is the same dead end, so this is
     its caller.

     PINNED (job-checkouts.json). It runs from its own worktree, advanced to
     origin/main by kipi-job-pinned.sh at the start of each run, never from the
     shared checkout a human works in (founder, 2026-11-08, separate worktrees).

     HOURLY, NOT DAILY. Each run writes at most one review and acts only on PRs 48h
     old with 12h of quiet, so most runs read and do nothing. The hour is the delay
     AFTER a PR crosses those two bars, not the whole wait: an approved PR that its
     own pipeline did not merge still waits 48h for this job (PR #659 round 1).

     PATH, USER AND LOGNAME, because the review step runs `claude -p` through
     pr-review-agent.sh: a bash login shell does not put ~/.local/bin on PATH
     (ASK-3823), and without USER and LOGNAME the keychain lookup answers "Not
     logged in" (ASK-1178). Same four keys as com.kipi.linear-alert-triage. -->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key><string>com.kipi.pr-owner</string>
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string><string>-lc</string>
    <string>cd __KIPI_REPO__ &amp;&amp; python3 q-system/.q-system/scripts/pr-owner.py --apply</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartInterval</key><integer>3600</integer>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>HOME</key><string>__HOME__</string>
    <key>USER</key><string>__USER__</string>
    <key>LOGNAME</key><string>__USER__</string>
    <key>PATH</key><string>__HOME__/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
  </dict>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key><false/>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>__HOME__/.config/kipi/pr-owner.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>__HOME__/.config/kipi/pr-owner.err</string>
</dict>
</plist>
